OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why China and AI are
OL,4,Aworrying global finance bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen it comes to the future direction
OL,7,Fof the global economy there is a bit of
OL,8,Fa tug of war going on.
OL,10,FThere are starkly opposing forces. On
OL,11,Fthe one hand holding back growth are
OL,12,Fthe familiar, recurring crises from the
OL,13,Fenergy shock, trade conflict and actual
OL,14,Fwar. This is reflected most clearly in
OL,15,Fthe sharply rising interest rate costs
OL,16,Ffor the world's advanced economies.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,114,105,200,300,0,100
