OL,3,AFaisal Islam: Why China and AI are
OL,4,Aworrying global finance bosses
OL,5,
OL,6,FPulling in the other direction is the
OL,7,Fboost from massive spending on AI, and
OL,8,Fthe frankly astonishing resilience
OL,9,Fshown especially by smaller economies,
OL,10,Fas new routes for trade, including for
OL,11,Foil and gas, have been established out
OL,12,Fof necessity.
OL,14,FAt the IMF meetings in Bangkok this
OL,15,Fweek these themes came up again and
OL,16,Fagain, including among those at the
OL,17,Fvery top table. But not even they know
OL,18,Fwhich way things are going to go.
